    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "keys": "n"
        },
        {
          "keys": "."
        }
      ],
      "caption": "And again. The Replace Loop.",
      "narration": "The classic Vim mass-edit. cgn is similar and even slicker — see cgn-dot.",
